I possessed the body of Julieta Orvetian, a minor villainess destined to die over a few petty words. I successfully avoided the main cast until the story ended, finally securing my survival. But just as I prepared for a peaceful life, the second male lead, Yezar, appeared with a startling offer.
&ldquo;Would you be interested in a contract marriage?&rdquo;
I viewed it as a business deal and expect…

Lorena chose death to take revenge on the husband who ruined her life. Thrown back in time, she is determined to rewrite her destiny, protect her family, and destroy her husband. There&rsquo;s only one way to win: a scandalous divorce.
&ldquo;I need a wild dog&hellip; because I&rsquo;m going to hunt down a hound.&rdquo;
A dangerous alliance. A deadly deal. Will she be able to take everything back …

Myeongha&rsquo;s beloved boyfriend Taeon&mdash;her pride and everything&mdash;has died, leaving behind a will addressed to his friend Jeongu: &ldquo;I leave all my assets to my beloved girlfriend.&rdquo;
But there&rsquo;s a twist&mdash;Taeon had not one, but three girlfriends.
Under Jeongu&rsquo;s supervision, a quiet yet intense battle unfolds. With 3 billion won at stake, only one can inherit it…

&ldquo;Cheong-un, parry the attack! Move faster or the obstacle course will kill you!&rdquo;
The progenitors of the great Wudang sect and the mighty Shaolin encounter post-ascension issues when they find themselves reduced to servants in the godly realm. Their only hope and escape from their divine chores lie in the hands of less-than-average Cheong-un, who can hardly beat his peers in the sect.
