With a handsome face and manners that would put a diplomat to shame, new hire Hyeonu Lee is a sight for sore eyes to Senior Manager Iyeon Shin when he walks through the doors of Hanshin Worldwide. Feeling like she&rsquo;s won the lottery, Iyeon is looking forward to her company life alongside this polite and hard-working young man&mdash;

&ldquo;Hey, Iyeon. Get this done by tomorrow.&rdquo;

Hyeon…

&ldquo;Who needs a bandit, anyway?&rdquo;
That&rsquo;s the last thing Ikoma Ichinose, a bandit-class hunter, heard before he got kicked out of his party and ran into a monster that would kill him.
But he was given a second chance at life in the form of a time-turning pocket watch.
&ldquo;Yeah, who needs a bandit?&rdquo;
This time, Ikoma chooses to be a gravity master to have a shot at becoming the…

&ldquo;Don&rsquo;t you dare expect kindness from me.&rdquo;
Gentle and noble paladin, Ezekiel Nichs, is shocked to find out that he has been sold off to marry Bloody Calliope, the vicious tyrant that single-handedly seized the Kingdom of Alfensiad. But it turns out the two knew each other from childhood, and the tyrant holds a seething grudge against Ezekiel.
Will Ezekiel be able to clear the air …

&ldquo;Please help! I&rsquo;ve been kidnapped by this man. Please call the police!&rdquo;
Just like any other night, Hyeseong spends his time playing games with an online friend, Nana. But when Nana goes AFK and accidentally leaves his mic on, Hyeseong hears the voice of a panicked girl crying for help, saying she&rsquo;s been kidnapped.
Once Nana gets back, he sounds suspicious of Hyeseong, even …

&ldquo;Can a human trust another human? To trust is to gamble. Then where should I bet?&rdquo;
The notorious mafia &ldquo;Sambuca&rdquo; abducts children and produces drugs. To fight against them, Miho Won, the heir of one of the wealthiest families in Korea, recruits immortal girl Suki Kang and former mafia member Lilia to form &ldquo;The QUEENS.&rdquo;
